### **3. README.md for Page Tables Lab**
# Xv6 Page Tables Lab 🐧

This lab is part of my journey through **MIT 6.1810 (Operating Systems)**, where I explored and modified **page tables** in **xv6**. The goal was to speed up system calls, print page tables, and use superpages to optimize memory usage.

